Package: platmon
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: systemd, init-system-helpers (>= 1.56)
Recommends: platmon-frontend
Maintainer: platmon maintainers <jwsung91@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/platmon/platmon
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: lightweight read-only Linux platform monitor
 Collects platform metrics with a static native server and exposes them in
 an HTTP API. The web page it serves and the terminal client, the platmon
 command, are in platmon-frontend.
